{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If an object is visible and approached, take it. Move to a location and check properties. Do task, then scan area. list of available nodes: <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = MoveToLocation    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <SubTree ID = SpecificTask    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectApproached    /> <Action ID = ScanArea    /> <Condition ID = CheckObjectProperties    />",
